                                        "sense_id": "10811b9f-b60b-345b-9fb0-239c21234b95",
                                        "entry_id": "a0c4b995-f4cf-362a-a14a-2c38dfd8edef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To set up; to organize; to put into an orderly sequence or arrangement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec83fc33-70f9-405e-9676-80517dc9d602",
                                                "sense_id": "10811b9f-b60b-345b-9fb0-239c21234b95",
                                                "text": "& whan the frensshe men sawe thus the hors come, whyche was longyng to rychard, they were al affrayed and moeued, and came & opened the gate, and anone he entred in; and after that the yate was shette, they arenged them aboute the sayd hors, for compassyon of sorowe, wepyng pyetously.",
