                                                "english": "And when the Frenchmen saw thus the horse come, which was longing for Richard, they were all afraid and moved, and came and opened the gate, and anon he entered in; and after the gate was shut, they arranged them about the said horse for compassion of sorrow, weeping piteously."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9629ad1-acbb-42cb-a832-74566b174a3c",
                                                "sense_id": "10811b9f-b60b-345b-9fb0-239c21234b95",
                                                "text": "The huge square box, parquet-floored and high-ceilinged, had been arranged to display a suite of bedroom furniture designed and made in the halcyon days of the last quarter of the nineteenth century,[…]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "739afc1d-62bc-37ca-9b68-6685150b44b9",
