                                                "text": "to arrange to meet; to arrange for supper"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78fd7c6a-4332-4650-9b2a-05c989671f4c",
                                                "sense_id": "739afc1d-62bc-37ca-9b68-6685150b44b9",
                                                "text": "It had been arranged as part of the day's programme that Mr. Cooke was to drive those who wished to go over the Rise in his new brake."
